sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Admin / Staf
  participant FE as Browser (Next.js Client)
  participant API as API Route /api/ai/process
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres
  participant P1 as Provider 1: OpenRouter
  participant P2 as Provider 2: Gemini

  U->>FE: Upload file dan tulis prompt
  FE->>API: POST /api/extract (file)
  API-->>FE: teks / tabel hasil ekstraksi
  FE->>API: POST /api/ai/process (prompt, content)
  API->>DB: insert extraction_runs, status=processing
  API->>P1: chat.completions.create()
  alt Provider 1 berhasil
    P1-->>API: teks JSON
  else Provider 1 gagal (error / rate limit)
    P1--xAPI: error / timeout
    API->>P2: generateContent()
    alt Provider 2 berhasil
      P2-->>API: teks JSON
    else Provider 2 juga gagal
      P2--xAPI: error
      API->>DB: update status=failed, error_message
      API-->>FE: HTTP 502 Layanan AI tidak tersedia
    end
  end
  API->>API: parseAiResult() dan validasi skema Zod
  API->>DB: update status=success, result_json, provider_used, model_used
  API-->>FE: summary, rows, providerUsed, modelUsed
  FE-->>U: Tampilkan tabel hasil dan tombol unduh
